{
    "title": "Cat Escape",
    "description": "Cat Escape: THE Cat Game!\r\n\r\nAmong all the cat games out there, Cat Escape is the one unique, funny, and satisfying puzzle you need. Control the cutest peppy cat in its sneaky and action-filled adventure \u2014 hiding from every sly security guard and escaping traps will bring you to the exit door and rewards behind it. Start the cat rescue and meow your way out!\r\n\r\nA Hit Cat Simulator with A - maze - ing Twists\r\nFan of kitty games? On the lookout for more addicting games about cats? It doesn\u2019t matter if you prefer cats or dogs: our furry escape artist will keep you entertained with carefully designed puzzles for all animal lovers out there.  \r\n\r\nEach level of Cat Escape is a labyrinth of security guards trying to trap the cat! They\u2019re armed with kitty detectors, nets, and the command to not let this cat run away! Beware: levels of this escape game get progressively more challenging! Lucky for you, unlike other cat games, there's not a dog around, but lots of power-ups and spots to hide for your sneaky gato:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3cHideouts: to take a break from hide and seek, evade the guards by sneaking into a closet until you\u2019re ready to continue the pet rescue mission.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3bCat Food: if you find a bowl of cat food, eat it! It will turn your sweet tomcat into a really bad kitty that can knock down walls.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3aPlant Cat Costume: Wear it to pretend you\u2019re not a kitten but a plant. Peekaboo with the enemies trying to trap the cat \u2014 complete stealth!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3cGuns: If you feel like a fierce battle cat, our puzzle kitty game lets you be one. Use guns to knock out guards or destroy walls, or even get inside a tank - own this cat world!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude38Portals: Teleport your peppy cat and continue your cat quest in another part of the room. We doubt you\u2019ve seen this in other free cat games! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude3aButtons: Push buttons to eliminate electric cats traps or remove pet barriers that won\u2019t let your pet escape. Or turn a trap on and shock the guards!\r\n\r\nCustomizable Ginger Cat \r\nIn this cat simulator, you start with the yellow cat but can change the look! Pick from many skins to change the cat breed \u2014 siamese, white, or gray like Talking Tom \u2014 or turn your kitty cat into a vampire, unicorn, spider, pirate, detective\u2026 It\u2019s a whole army of battle cats! Mix and match the skin with trails: hearts, bubbles, rainbows. In this cat-simulator puzzle, it\u2019s so easy to make your kitten match your mood \u2014 keep your adventure in style!\r\n\r\nSneak, hide, and run to the exit, one paw at a time. Use your logic to move through hundreds of satisfying levels \u2014 unseen in other kitten games. In this cat game, you\u2019ll visit a cat school, a museum, and even a vampire mansion \u2014 each designed to make your cat life difficult. Don\u2019t worry \u2014 you\u2019ve got it! Among other cat-games, Cat Escape is the one feel-good cats game that always keeps you entertained. A satisfying mix of adorable and funny, challenging and relaxing, Cat Escape is the top-tier feline adventure among other kitty cat games.\r\n\r\nLet the Hiding Kitty Games Begin!\r\nCat Escape stands out in the world of cat games. You're a kitty, trapped in rooms bustling with guards and traps. This kitty game challenges you to find your way out, making a name for itself among kitty cat games. Your kitty cat needs to run and escape in this thrilling cat game. It's like a fun cat simulator for cat-games fans - whether you're a kitten fan, a kitty enthusiast, or a cats lover. So, cats fans, enjoy a dash of battle cats excitement in this digital cat-simulator extravaganza! Put on your game face and experience the thrill of being a kitty in a world full of adventures. No need to wait for the World Cat Day: download Cat Escape for free and see why this hyper-casual cat-simulator is so adored by all fans of kitten games. Enjoy it and don\u2019t forget to check out the rest of the fun, addictive, and clever hyper-casual games created by Sunday.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cat Escape: THE Cat Game!<br><br>Among all the cat games out there, Cat Escape is the one unique, funny, and satisfying puzzle you need. Control the cutest peppy cat in its sneaky and action-filled adventure \u2014 hiding from every sly security guard and escaping traps will bring you to the exit door and rewards behind it. Start the cat rescue and meow your way out!<br><br>A Hit Cat Simulator with A - maze - ing Twists<br>Fan of kitty games? On the lookout for more addicting games about cats? It doesn\u2019t matter if you prefer cats or dogs: our furry escape artist will keep you entertained with carefully designed puzzles for all animal lovers out there.  <br><br>Each level of Cat Escape is a labyrinth of security guards trying to trap the cat! They\u2019re armed with kitty detectors, nets, and the command to not let this cat run away! Beware: levels of this escape game get progressively more challenging! Lucky for you, unlike other cat games, there&#39;s not a dog around, but lots of power-ups and spots to hide for your sneaky gato:<br><br>\ud83d\ude3cHideouts: to take a break from hide and seek, evade the guards by sneaking into a closet until you\u2019re ready to continue the pet rescue mission.<br><br>\ud83d\ude3bCat Food: if you find a bowl of cat food, eat it! It will turn your sweet tomcat into a really bad kitty that can knock down walls.<br><br>\ud83d\ude3aPlant Cat Costume: Wear it to pretend you\u2019re not a kitten but a plant. Peekaboo with the enemies trying to trap the cat \u2014 complete stealth!<br><br>\ud83d\ude3cGuns: If you feel like a fierce battle cat, our puzzle kitty game lets you be one. Use guns to knock out guards or destroy walls, or even get inside a tank - own this cat world!<br><br>\ud83d\ude38Portals: Teleport your peppy cat and continue your cat quest in another part of the room. We doubt you\u2019ve seen this in other free cat games! <br><br>\ud83d\ude3aButtons: Push buttons to eliminate electric cats traps or remove pet barriers that won\u2019t let your pet escape. Or turn a trap on and shock the guards!<br><br>Customizable Ginger Cat <br>In this cat simulator, you start with the yellow cat but can change the look! Pick from many skins to change the cat breed \u2014 siamese, white, or gray like Talking Tom \u2014 or turn your kitty cat into a vampire, unicorn, spider, pirate, detective\u2026 It\u2019s a whole army of battle cats! Mix and match the skin with trails: hearts, bubbles, rainbows. In this cat-simulator puzzle, it\u2019s so easy to make your kitten match your mood \u2014 keep your adventure in style!<br><br>Sneak, hide, and run to the exit, one paw at a time. Use your logic to move through hundreds of satisfying levels \u2014 unseen in other kitten games. In this cat game, you\u2019ll visit a cat school, a museum, and even a vampire mansion \u2014 each designed to make your cat life difficult. Don\u2019t worry \u2014 you\u2019ve got it! Among other cat-games, Cat Escape is the one feel-good cats game that always keeps you entertained. A satisfying mix of adorable and funny, challenging and relaxing, Cat Escape is the top-tier feline adventure among other kitty cat games.<br><br>Let the Hiding Kitty Games Begin!<br>Cat Escape stands out in the world of cat games. You&#39;re a kitty, trapped in rooms bustling with guards and traps. This kitty game challenges you to find your way out, making a name for itself among kitty cat games. Your kitty cat needs to run and escape in this thrilling cat game. It&#39;s like a fun cat simulator for cat-games fans - whether you&#39;re a kitten fan, a kitty enthusiast, or a cats lover. So, cats fans, enjoy a dash of battle cats excitement in this digital cat-simulator extravaganza! Put on your game face and experience the thrill of being a kitty in a world full of adventures. No need to wait for the World Cat Day: download Cat Escape for free and see why this hyper-casual cat-simulator is so adored by all fans of kitten games. Enjoy it and don\u2019t forget to check out the rest of the fun, addictive, and clever hyper-casual games created by Sunday.",
